  "releaseNotes": "* Version 6.0.0: This is the last MIT-licensed release of this library. Future releases will require a (potentially free) commercial license. See https://nimbletools.io/news/ardalis-nuget-packages/\n            * Updated target frameworks to net11.0, net10.0, and netstandard2.0; dropped net8.0 and netstandard2.1, which are no longer supported (#419)\n            * Fixed Guard.Against.Expression to support reference types by removing the struct constraint (#339, #406)\n            * Fixed Guard.Against.LengthOutOfRange so the exception keeps the parameter name and custom message (#422)\n            * Updated Microsoft.SourceLink.GitHub to 10.0.400 (#410)\n            * Package license is now declared as an MIT license expression (#359)\n            * NuGet package now ships a dedicated readme (readme-nuget.md)\n            * Updating to 5.0 because 4.6 had breaking logic (see #354)\n            * Updated Obsolete message for Guard.Against.Expression to clarify reversal of logic (#457)",
